<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="822.54" endTime="831.627">
<Sync time="822.54"/>
Pos nehwa nik..., nehwa nejó:n niki:xmati ne:n chokoymeh yehwa yo:n tehwa:n tikiliah *borreguillos**, ke:mah.
